landed: done (2026-07-09). T1..T3 green at all layers. T1 confirmed
repl_back is exactly truncate -1's sugar: 2 steps -> back -> 1 step ->
back -> 0 steps -> back -> "out of range" error, the same message
truncate gives on an empty repl. T2 confirmed the description's trap is
real: step ok, step FAILS, back -- the surviving repl has 0 steps, not
